 "d": [
  {"i":4153,"keep":[],"n":"'Capital/seat of government' appears mostly in compounds like 中央政府; learners meet 中央 as 'centre', so position is enough"},
  {"i":4155,"keep":[],"n":"'Calculation, expectation' (計算通り) is a figurative extension of reckoning and would not be taught in a thinking unit"},
  {"i":4161,"keep":[2],"n":"風邪が移る (to catch a cold) is very common everyday usage and belongs in a health unit"},
  {"i":4163,"keep":[4],"n":"千円札を崩す (to break a bill) is common daily usage and fits a money unit"},
  {"i":4178,"keep":[3],"n":"興味が湧く and 勇気が湧く are common, and feelings that well up fit a feelings unit"},
  {"i":4186,"keep":[],"n":"Sense 1 is mainly 'establishment' (目標を設定する); 'story setting' is a narrow sub-use, not an arts-unit word"},
  {"i":4187,"keep":[2],"n":"車に酔う and 船酔い (motion sickness) are common and taught with transport and health"},
  {"i":4198,"keep":[2],"n":"'Attitude, stance' (前向きな姿勢) is a common N3 sense and fits opinions and thinking"},
  {"i":4202,"keep":[],"n":"'Biological tissue' is technical and rare at this level"},
  {"i":4209,"keep":[4],"n":"パソコンが固まる (the computer froze) is very common and fits a technology unit"},
  {"i":4211,"keep":[2],"n":"新聞に載る (to appear in the paper) is a core sense and a media-unit word"},
  {"i":4215,"keep":[3],"n":"意志を貫く (to stick to one's will or principles) is a standard common sense tied to convictions"},
  {"i":4229,"keep":[],"n":"Contact with people is formal (接触を避ける) and would not be taught in a friends or relationships unit"},
  {"i":4234,"keep":[2],"n":"時計が狂う and 予定が狂う (to be off or out of order) are common, and things going off fits qualities"},
  {"i":4236,"keep":[5],"n":"風邪を移す (to give someone a cold) is common and fits a health unit"},
  {"i":4260,"keep":[2],"n":"氷 as shaved ice (the 氷 shop flag, かき氷) is a familiar summer dessert, so it belongs in food"},
  {"i":4261,"keep":[],"n":"'Gloom in one's expression' is figurative and literary"},
  {"i":4266,"keep":[],"n":"'To compare with' (法律に照らして) is formal and rare for learners"},
  {"i":4267,"keep":[],"n":"The degree-adverb sense (いい加減疲れた) is less common, and a teacher would not teach it in a function-word unit"},
  {"i":4285,"keep":[5],"n":"お金に細かい (stingy, fussy about money) is common and describes personality"},
  {"i":4292,"keep":[2],"n":"緑が多い (lots of greenery) is very common and fits plants and nature"},
  {"i":4299,"keep":[],"n":"'Religious enlightenment' is specialised; learners meet 悟る as 'realize'"}
